            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lovestohost"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I like to say \"Mo-Jee-Toe\", but I don't tend to like drinking them as much as I like saying their name. This recipe intrigued me w/it's use of Captain (R). It didn't disappoint! The only slight modification I made was to use Diet 7-Up in lieu of soda water (though, in thinking about it, perhaps it's not a modification, after all...). I can definately see making this again when we have fresh mint on hand. CHEERS, byrnesette!",
